WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:05.600
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today, I’m going to&nbsp;
explain an American film called “Bubble Boy.” 
&nbsp;

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.880
Spoilers ahead! Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:17.440
A boy named Jimmy Livingston is born with no&nbsp;
immunity whatsoever. Even a little germ can kill&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:23.200
him, so he has to be kept in isolation. He cannot&nbsp;
touch anything without it being decontaminated.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:27.600
Hence, he will have to live inside a bubble-like&nbsp;
plastic sphere for all his life to survive.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:33.680
His mother, Mrs. Livingston, is overprotective&nbsp;
of her son. Until he was four years old,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:38.640
he wasn’t even allowed to come home. However,&nbsp;
after he turned four, she and Mr. Livingston&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:44.000
bring the little boy home in his bubble. His room&nbsp;
too has a huge bubble, so he can walk inside it.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.440
The bubble has a pair of protruded hands&nbsp;
that his parents can use to “touch” him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:52.400
All his toys are decontaminated to be free of the&nbsp;
smallest of the germs and kept inside the bubble.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:57.520
Jimmy has lived in that room ever since. Mrs.&nbsp;
Livingston doesn’t ever want him to leave the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:57.520 --> 00:01:02.560
bubble, so she ends all the bedtime stories with&nbsp;
the princess dying because they were let free. He&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:02.560 --> 00:01:07.520
is only allowed to watch one tv channel and read&nbsp;
one magazine, because Mrs. Livingston insists they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:07.520 --> 00:01:12.480
are the only ones ever made. She also uses the&nbsp;
protruded arms to cut his hair and hug her son.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:13.120 --> 00:01:17.360
Mrs. Livingston is an extreme nationalist,&nbsp;
so she teaches Jimmy only the things she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:17.360 --> 00:01:22.560
thinks are reasonable and forces her ideas on&nbsp;
him. However, poor Jimmy doesn't know better,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:22.560 --> 00:01:26.720
so he goes along with it. Everyone in the&nbsp;
city knows about the unique bubble boy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:26.720 --> 00:01:31.680
but it doesn’t work to his advantage. Instead,&nbsp;
the neighbour kids wrap themselves in plastic&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:31.680 --> 00:01:36.000
wrap and make fun of Jimmy outside his home,&nbsp;
Mrs. Livingston chases them away frequently. 
&nbsp;

00:01:36.720 --> 00:01:41.200
The only food Jimmy eats is homemade. A&nbsp;
decontamination system has been placed in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:46.640
a plastic tube, where Mrs. Livingston places his&nbsp;
food to kill the germs before Jimmy can fetch it.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:46.640 --> 00:01:51.920
Jimmy is now sixteen years old. He narrates that&nbsp;
he grew up like any other kid and is happy when&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:51.920 --> 00:01:57.040
he gets an electrical guitar instead of a car.&nbsp;
Until one day, he is at his window when he sees&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:57.040 --> 00:02:01.920
a new girl his age named Chloe moving into his&nbsp;
neighborhood. He has grown to like the girl,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:01.920 --> 00:02:06.880
but cannot do anything about it. More so, he&nbsp;
doesn’t know anything about love or girls.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:06.880 --> 00:02:11.760
His mother senses his infatuation, and recites&nbsp;
the story to Jimmy about a boy who died because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:11.760 --> 00:02:16.160
he touched the “next door whore”. For the next&nbsp;
few years, Jimmy watches Chloe through his windows&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:16.160 --> 00:02:20.640
a lot, she also notices him watching her. He&nbsp;
narrates that he knows something is happening&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:25.760
to him, but he doesn’t know what. One morning,&nbsp;
he wakes up with an erection and is petrified.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:25.760 --> 00:02:30.080
Unknown to the concept, he hits himself&nbsp;
with a bat; he cries and calls his mother.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:30.640 --> 00:02:35.520
Mrs. Livingston comes in and makes him repeat the&nbsp;
pledge of allegiance until he calms down. Chloe&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:35.520 --> 00:02:40.480
has a group of popular friends who make fun of&nbsp;
Jimmy, calling him the bubble boy. She seems to be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:40.480 --> 00:02:45.760
defensive towards him. One day, she knocks on the&nbsp;
Livingston’s door and Mr. Livingston lets her in.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:46.400 --> 00:02:50.240
She sees the system of plastic tubes all&nbsp;
around the house, and is fascinated. 
&nbsp;

00:02:50.960 --> 00:02:55.600
She follows the tube and reaches Jimmy’s room.&nbsp;
Jimmy is surprised and nervous because his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:55.600 --> 00:03:00.480
mother is the only woman he has talked to. Chloe&nbsp;
talks to him and tells him she like his guitar.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:01.040 --> 00:03:05.520
Jimmy tries teaching her to play it with the&nbsp;
protruded hands. He starts reciting the pledge&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:05.520 --> 00:03:10.480
of allegiance in the middle of it. Starting&nbsp;
that day, the two hang out together every day.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:10.480 --> 00:03:15.120
Mrs. Livingston doesn’t like their friendship,&nbsp;
but cannot do anything about it. A montage of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:15.120 --> 00:03:19.440
them spending time together follows. 
She gives him a guinea pig inside a ball&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:19.440 --> 00:03:25.200
for his birthday, and even brings kids inside his&nbsp;
room for Halloween. One night, on her birthday,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:30.400
a drunk Chloe sneaks inside Jimmy’s room through&nbsp;
the windows. She tries getting inside the bubble,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:30.400 --> 00:03:35.360
claiming she cannot stay away from him anymore.&nbsp;
However, she passes out before she can go in. 
&nbsp;

00:03:36.160 --> 00:03:40.880
The scene cuts to Chloe’s prom night. Her&nbsp;
perverted boyfriend, Mark, comes to pick her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:40.880 --> 00:03:46.320
up and Jimmy is devastated. Mark offers Jimmy&nbsp;
a cigarette but he doesn’t know what it is. 
&nbsp;

00:03:46.320 --> 00:03:49.440
One night, Jimmy sees Mark and&nbsp;
Chloe make out through his windows.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:54.000
The very next day, Chloe comes into Jimmy’s&nbsp;
room and shows him her engagement ring.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:54.640 --> 00:03:59.200
Mark had proposed to her to marry him. Their&nbsp;
marriage is this weekend at Niagara falls,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:59.200 --> 00:04:03.600
and she has come to inform Jimmy. Jimmy is&nbsp;
disappointed but doesn’t show it in his face.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:04.160 --> 00:04:09.360
She has also brought him a gift, which she keeps&nbsp;
inside his decontamination tube, but Jimmy ignores&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:09.360 --> 00:04:15.040
it. Instead, he gives her the guinea pig back, and&nbsp;
asks her to go away. Chloe leaves with tears in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:15.040 --> 00:04:20.720
her eyes. Later, Jimmy opens the gift, and sees it&nbsp;
is a snow globe with “I love you” written inside.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:25.920
Surprised, he screams her name and decides to&nbsp;
go to Niagara falls, to stop the wedding. 
&nbsp;

00:04:26.640 --> 00:04:31.360
He works hard to make himself a portable&nbsp;
bubble shield, and is finally successful. Then,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:31.360 --> 00:04:35.600
he sneaks out of the house without his parents&nbsp;
knowing. Jimmy is happy to be running for the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:35.600 --> 00:04:40.000
first time, he reaches the bus station and&nbsp;
asks the person there for a bus ticket.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:45.040
However, Jimmy has forgotten to bring any&nbsp;
money. Distressed, he tries to cross the road,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:45.040 --> 00:04:49.440
when he is hit by a bus. He goes flying&nbsp;
to the ground, but his bubble saves him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:54.480
The people from the bus come out and offer&nbsp;
to give him a ride. Jimmy happily accepts it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:54.480 --> 00:04:58.960
but he gets to know that the people are part&nbsp;
of a religious cult. When he points it out,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:58.960 --> 00:05:03.280
they angrily throw him out of the bus. The&nbsp;
cult group reaches their destination, where&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:03.280 --> 00:05:08.320
their leader announces a round man inside a globe&nbsp;
to be the savior sent by god. The group realizes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:08.320 --> 00:05:12.080
that Jimmy was their saviour, and sets off to&nbsp;
look for him to take him out of the “globe”. 
&nbsp;

00:05:12.880 --> 00:05:17.920
Meanwhile, Jimmy meets a biker named Slim. Jimmy&nbsp;
tells him about the love of his life marrying&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:23.280
someone else. Slim is impressed, and in turn tells&nbsp;
him of his old girlfriend who he still loves named&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:23.280 --> 00:05:28.240
wildfire. He then offers Jimmy a ride, and both&nbsp;
of them make their way to Niagara Falls. 
&nbsp;

00:05:29.040 --> 00:05:32.800
At home, Mrs. Livingston finds&nbsp;
Jimmy missing and freaks out.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:32.800 --> 00:05:37.200
Mrs. Livingston and her husband set out to look&nbsp;
for Jimmy, because the police would only do it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:37.200 --> 00:05:42.880
after twenty-four hours of the disappearance. 
Elsewhere, Slim and Jimmy reach Vegas and stop to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:42.880 --> 00:05:47.760
rest. They have a lot of fun at a casino, but&nbsp;
Jimmy only has two days before the wedding.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:48.320 --> 00:05:53.920
So, he leaves Slim at the club, steals a scooter,&nbsp;
and runs away in it. After traveling for a while,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:53.920 --> 00:05:58.480
Jimmy comes across his parent’s car, who&nbsp;
tries to stop him from running. In a hurry,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:58.480 --> 00:06:03.600
Jimmy gets into an accident. But thankfully,&nbsp;
his bubble bounces him into a running train.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:03.600 --> 00:06:08.480
He escapes his mother but is now trapped in a&nbsp;
train with talents from a freak show. The freaks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:08.480 --> 00:06:13.680
tell him about their boss, Dr. Phreak, who keeps&nbsp;
them captured and uses them in his freak show.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:13.680 --> 00:06:18.960
Jimmy meets Dr. Phreak, who happens to be a dwarf.&nbsp;
He accidentally throws the man to the ground with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:18.960 --> 00:06:24.320
his bubble, and frees the other freaks. Then&nbsp;
he continues his way to Niagara Falls. But he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:29.760
can hardly use a scooter anymore, so he goes to&nbsp;
a restaurant to ask someone for a ride. There,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:29.760 --> 00:06:35.120
a bunch of police officers bully a man named&nbsp;
Pushpop. When Jimmy tells them he has no immunity,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:40.240
they assume Jimmy has a contagious disease, and&nbsp;
run away from the place. The restaurant catches&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:40.240 --> 00:06:45.920
on fire in the chaos, and Pushpop offers Jimmy a&nbsp;
ride. He also agrees to take him to Niagara Falls.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:46.480 --> 00:06:50.880
Somewhere else, Mrs. Livingston reaches Dr.&nbsp;
Phreak, who tells her that Jimmy is going to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:50.880 --> 00:06:56.960
Niagara Falls. Furious, she calls Chloe and yells&nbsp;
at her for making Jimmy run away. As she talks to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:56.960 --> 00:07:02.560
Dr. Phreak, the freaks outside steal her car. 
Pushpop and Jimmy are on their way, when they hit&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:02.560 --> 00:07:07.360
a cow in the middle of the road. Pushpop is&nbsp;
distressed because, in his religion, cows&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:11.920
are a symbol of god, but following his mother’s&nbsp;
word, Jimmy tells him that his religion is false.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:12.480 --> 00:07:17.840
This offends Pushpop, so he leaves Jimmy on&nbsp;
his own. Jimmy then somehow reaches New York;&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:17.840 --> 00:07:23.440
he asks for a ride from an old man named Pippy, to&nbsp;
which he agrees. Jimmy wakes up the next morning&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:23.440 --> 00:07:28.320
and the man is still driving the car. Jimmy&nbsp;
soon realizes that Pippy is lying lifeless,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:28.320 --> 00:07:32.720
and the car hits a billboard. Jimmy goes&nbsp;
into a grocery store and calls Chloe. 
&nbsp;

00:07:33.440 --> 00:07:37.840
Mark picks up the phone and tells Jimmy to give&nbsp;
up, because he is about to marry Chloe in an hour.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:38.400 --> 00:07:42.000
He is now hopeless, so he calls his&nbsp;
mother and asks her to come to pick him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:47.440
Both his parents drive to him, and get him inside&nbsp;
the car. Mrs Livingston goes to the washroom,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:52.480
when Mr. Livingston asks Jimmy how it felt to be&nbsp;
outside for the first time. The father and son&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:52.480 --> 00:07:58.320
bond. Mr Livingston tells Jimmy to not give up&nbsp;
before trying. Taking his words, Jimmy runs to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:58.320 --> 00:08:03.920
stop the wedding. Mrs. Livingston sees this, and&nbsp;
follows him in their car. At the same time, the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:09.200
cult group finds Jimmy and follows him as well.&nbsp;
Slim, with his biker friends, comes to rescue&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:09.200 --> 00:08:14.320
Jimmy too. Slim locks eyes with Mrs Livingston,&nbsp;
who happens to be his old love wildfire. 
&nbsp;

00:08:15.040 --> 00:08:19.920
Turns out all of them are driving on a plane’s&nbsp;
runway. A plane takes off and Jimmy gets on board&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:19.920 --> 00:08:25.200
with an old pilot. They fly to Niagara falls,&nbsp;
but the plane crashes, making Jimmy fall into the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:25.200 --> 00:08:31.040
waterfall. Thankfully, his bubble doesn’t let him&nbsp;
drown. He somehow manages to get out of the water&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:31.040 --> 00:08:36.240
and rushes his way to the wedding. Chloe and Mark&nbsp;
are in the chapel, saying their vows, when Jimmy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:36.240 --> 00:08:41.280
enters the church, claiming his love for her.&nbsp;
Seeing this is his last chance to persuade Chloe,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:41.280 --> 00:08:46.480
he puts his life in danger, and tears his&nbsp;
bubble open to kiss her. However, just after it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:46.480 --> 00:08:51.680
he falls unconscious. As Chloe tries to wake him&nbsp;
up, Mr. and Mrs. Livingston arrive there too.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:52.320 --> 00:08:56.800
Mrs. Livingston mourns her son’s death, when Mr.&nbsp;
Livington asks her to tell everyone the truth.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:57.360 --> 00:09:02.000
Mrs. Livingston embarrassingly reveals, that&nbsp;
Jimmy doesn’t have any condition, and he suddenly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:02.000 --> 00:09:06.640
wakes up. It turns out that she had lied to him to&nbsp;
keep him away from the evils of the world for all&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:06.640 --> 00:09:12.080
these years. Jimmy is shocked, but forgives his&nbsp;
mother when she claims she did it to protect him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:12.080 --> 00:09:17.920
He finally embraces Chloe as everyone claps. 
Cut to a few months later. Chloe and Jimmy are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:17.920 --> 00:09:22.880
getting married. Everyone he met during his&nbsp;
journey is at the wedding. Mr. Livingston,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:22.880 --> 00:09:28.080
Mrs. Livingston, and Slim are now a throuple.&nbsp;
The movie ends as we see Jimmy and Chloe drive&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:28.080 --> 00:09:32.160
away in a car to their honeymoon. 
